Package: argon-oneup-essentials
Version: 1.3.5
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: Hardware tuning, antenna/NVMe & blower fan curve for Argon ONE UP laptop
 Configures essential hardware parameters for the Argon ONE UP laptop
 (Raspberry Pi Compute Module 5 / Pi 5):
  - External display-lid Wi-Fi/BT antenna selection (dtparam=ant2)
  - M.2 NVMe PCIe Gen 3 full-speed mode (dtparam=nvme, pciex1_gen=3)
  - 2.8 GHz CPU boost & 4-stage quiet blower fan curve with 5C hysteresis
  - BCM2712 PMIC halt power-off, 5A PSU limit & SDRAM 8-bank interleaving
  - Hardware probe disables for unrouted CSI/DSI/UART0 interfaces
  - Touchpad tap-to-click & USB audio wireplumber routing
